  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\">Солнце и Луна Круглые</strong></span></span></h1>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>RUSSIAN</strong></span></h2>\n<p><strong>🌙☀️ Солнце и Луна Круглые преобразуют небо в Minecraft, заменяя классические солнце и luna на идеально круглые версии. Этот текстурный пакет предлагает более чистый и современный стиль, сохраняя игру при этом с более отточенной визуальной отделкой.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>✨ Идеально подходит для игроков, которые ищут более простое, эстетичное и естественное небо в их мире.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>1.21 BETA</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>&nbsp; От @d_de_diego_d</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\"></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>ESPA&Ntilde;OL</strong></span></h2>\n<div>\n<article>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span>🌙☀️ </span><span>Sun </span><span>and </span><span>Moon </span><span>Circular</span> <span>transforma </span><span>el </span><span>cielo </span><span>de </span><span>Minecraft </span><span>reemplazando </span><span>el </span><span>sol </span><span>y </span><span>la </span><span>luna </span><span>cl&aacute;sicos </span><span>por </span><span>versiones </span><span>perfectamente </span><span>circulares</span><span>. </span><span>Este </span><span>texture </span><span>pack </span><span>ofrece </span><span>un </span><span>aspecto </span><span>m&aacute;s </span><span>limpio </span><span>y </span><span>moderno, </span><span>manteniendo </span><span>el </span><span>estilo </span><span>del </span><span>juego </span><span>pero </span><span>con </span><span>un </span><span>toque </span><span>visual </span><span>m&aacute;s </span><span>pulido.</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>✨ </span><span>Perfecto </span><span>para </span><span>jugadores </span><span>que </span><span>buscan </span><span>un </span><span>cielo </span><span>m&aacute;s </span><span>simple, </span><span>est&eacute;tico </span><span>y </span><span>natural</span> <span>en </span><span>su </span><span>mundo.</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>By @d_de_diego_d</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>❤️ Поддержите Меня ❤️</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/wURmd9P3qq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/discord.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\" width=\"180\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fddediegood\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232953/description_68549b52-a129-4666-80cb-67f09f5db302.png\" alt=\"Support me on Patreon\" width=\"205\" height=\"70\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540texturepacks_mc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232953/description_24a6377c-de2d-48a7-a0a9-5c2642f644cb.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"56\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ddediegod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/youtube.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"Youtube Channel\" width=\"207\" height=\"60\"></a></strong><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fadfoc.us%252f%253frefid%253d871639\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://med